  (text "Node: both open = 0x10 (audio bridge), JP1 = 0x11, JP2 = 0x12." (at 15 322 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "613e9052-895b-5904-bb98-71abaaab8d99"))
  (text "PCM5102A: 3-wire I2S, SCK tied to ground (internal PLL from BCK, BCK must be 64 fS), FMT low = I2S, FLT low, DEMP low.\nXSMT is driven by GPIO4 and pulled low, so the outputs stay muted until the firmware un-mutes them (no boot pop).\nLine outputs are ground-centred 2.1 Vrms: no DC-block caps. 470 R + 2.2n at each output as in the datasheet. Both DACs share BCK / LRCK; each has its own data line (front GPIO27, rear GPIO26)." (at 330 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "efe33b6f-4da5-53e4-9756-3808b94330f7"))
  (symbol (lib_id "AudioCarrier:PCM5102A_TSSOP20") (at 340 90 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "222fced2-a94e-5d26-b28b-bdadf9c6f051")
