  (text "MICROPHONE: 3.5 mm TRS jack. Tip = electret mic (2.2k bias from filtered 3.3 V, DC-blocked), ring = second input (line / aux, no bias).\nMic preamp: OPA2376 non-inverting, gain 1 + 47k / 2.2k = 22 (27 dB), DC gain 1 at mid-supply (2.5 V). Ring input is a unity-gain buffer. PCM1808 full scale is 3 Vp-p (about 1 Vrms)." (at 30 340 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c8f9ed9b-8a23-5632-be85-09b80005228f"))
